1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,653
Third, temperature.

2
00:00:01,653 --> 00:00:07,408
A ten degree rise near room temperature usually doubles or even trebles the rate.

3
00:00:07,408 --> 00:00:08,658
Why so much?

4
00:00:08,658 --> 00:00:10,846
It is not the extra collisions.

5
00:00:10,846 --> 00:00:18,007
Collision frequency rises only with the square root of T, under two percent for ten degrees.

